<title>UK: Hamburg LB sets $200 mln three-year bond.</title>
<headline>Hamburg LB sets $200 mln three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HAMBURGISCHE LANDESBANK GZ</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	COUPON     6.25	MATURITY    07.FEB.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.8225  PAY DATE    07.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    99.635    SPREAD	+10 BP</p>
<p> IBCA	 AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 GOV LAW     ENGLISH</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.1875    SELL CONC  1.1875    PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
